#: src/widgets/introduction/application.vala:8
msgid "Welcome to ProtonPlus"
msgstr "Selamat datang di ProtonPlus"

#: src/widgets/introduction/application.vala:9
msgid ""
"ProtonPlus helps you easily manage, install, and update compatibility layers "
"for running Windows games on Linux."
msgstr ""
"ProtonPlus membantu Anda mengelola, menginstal, dan memperbarui lapisan "
"kompatibilitas untuk menjalankan game Windows di Linux dengan mudah."

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:31
msgid "Controller support"
msgstr "Dukungan kontroler"

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:45
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigasi"

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:46
msgid ""
"Use the D-pad or sticks to move through pages, dialogs, and menus. Switch "
"sections with the shoulder buttons."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan D-pad atau stik untuk bergerak melalui halaman, dialog, dan menu. "
"Ganti bagian dengan tombol bahu."

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:50
msgid ""
"Use the face buttons for Confirm, Back, Search, and Filter. Hints match your "
"controller's button labels."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan tombol wajah untuk Konfirmasi, Kembali, Cari, dan Filter. Petunjuk "
"cocok dengan label tombol kontroler Anda."

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:57
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferensi"

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:58
msgid ""
"Choose the Confirm button and enable controller vibration in Preferences."
msgstr "Pilih tombol Konfirmasi dan aktifkan getaran kontroler di Preferensi."

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:61
msgid "Text input"
msgstr "Input teks"

#: src/widgets/introduction/controller.vala:62
msgid ""
"On Steam Deck, focus a text field and press Steam + X. Other systems may "
"require a physical or system keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Di Steam Deck, fokuskan bidang teks dan tekan Steam + X. Sistem lain mungkin "
"memerlukan keyboard fisik atau sistem."

#: src/widgets/introduction/forks.vala:8
msgid "Custom Forks & Flavors"
msgstr "Fork & Varian Khusus"

#: src/widgets/introduction/forks.vala:9
msgid ""
"Community versions like Proton-GE provide cutting-edge fixes, video codecs, "
"and game-specific tweaks before they hit the official releases."
msgstr ""
"Versi komunitas seperti Proton-GE menyediakan perbaikan mutakhir, codec "
"video, dan penyesuaian khusus game sebelum dirilis resmi."

#: src/widgets/introduction/how-to-use.vala:8
msgid "How to Use"
msgstr "Cara Menggunakan"

#: src/widgets/introduction/how-to-use.vala:9
msgid ""
"Simply browse the available compatibility tools, click download, and "
"ProtonPlus will automatically configure them for your launchers like Steam, "
"Heroic, or Lutris."
msgstr ""
"Cukup jelajahi alat kompatibilitas yang tersedia, klik unduh, dan ProtonPlus "
"akan mengonfigurasinya secara otomatis untuk launcher Anda seperti Steam, "
"Heroic, atau Lutris."

#: src/widgets/introduction/introduction.vala:17
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pengantar"

#: src/widgets/introduction/introduction.vala:53
#: src/widgets/introduction/introduction.vala:55
msgid "Previous Page"
msgstr "Halaman Sebelumnya"

#: src/widgets/introduction/introduction.vala:62
#: src/widgets/introduction/introduction.vala:64
msgid "Next Page"
msgstr "Halaman Selanjutnya"

#: src/widgets/introduction/proton.vala:8
msgid "What is Proton?"
msgstr "Apa itu Proton?"

#: src/widgets/introduction/proton.vala:9
msgid ""
"Developed by Valve, Proton is a tool based on Wine specifically optimized "
"for gaming, ensuring high performance and Steam Play integration."
msgstr ""
"Dikembangkan oleh Valve, Proton adalah alat berbasis Wine yang dioptimalkan "
"khusus untuk gaming, memastikan kinerja tinggi dan integrasi Steam Play."

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:8
msgid "Keep Everything Updated"
msgstr "Jaga Semua Tetap Terbaru"

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:9
msgid ""
"ProtonPlus can automatically check for and install updates to keep your "
"gaming experience smooth."
msgstr ""
"ProtonPlus dapat secara otomatis memeriksa dan menginstal pembaruan untuk "
"menjaga pengalaman gaming Anda tetap lancar."

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:17
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:77
msgid "Background updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan latar belakang"

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:18
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:78
msgid "Automatically update the tools in the background"
msgstr "Perbarui alat secara otomatis di latar belakang"

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:24
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:84
msgid "Set how often to check for updates in the background"
msgstr "Atur seberapa sering memeriksa pembaruan di latar belakang"

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:30
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:90
msgid "Update tools at system startup"
msgstr "Perbarui alat saat sistem dimulai"

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:31
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:91
msgid "Automatically check for and install updates when the system starts"
msgstr "Secara otomatis periksa dan instal pembaruan saat sistem dimulai"

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:37
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:97
msgid "Update tools when ProtonPlus starts"
msgstr "Perbarui alat saat ProtonPlus dimulai"

#: src/widgets/introduction/updates.vala:38
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:98
msgid "Automatically check for and install updates when ProtonPlus starts"
msgstr "Secara otomatis periksa dan instal pembaruan saat ProtonPlus dimulai"

#: src/widgets/introduction/wine.vala:8
msgid "What is Wine?"
msgstr "Apa itu Wine?"

#: src/widgets/introduction/wine.vala:9
msgid ""
"Wine is a compatibility layer capable of running Windows applications on "
"Linux systems by translating Windows API calls on the fly."
msgstr ""
"Wine adalah lapisan kompatibilitas yang mampu menjalankan aplikasi Windows "
"di sistem Linux dengan menerjemahkan panggilan API Windows secara langsung."

#: src/widgets/loading/loading-box.vala:54
msgid "Loading"
msgstr "Memuat"

